Items to wish for have been discussed a lot here, though I don't agree
with some of what I've seen.  Here's my version:

Your blessed tinning kit is good to have, though my first wish is always
going to be 2 (or 3) blessed scrolls of charging.  You can read one of
these and recharge the wand to get more wishes.  (This only works once.)
If the wand originally had 3 charges, you can end up with 7 wishes total.
I'd wish for:

	2 blessed scrolls of charging
	blessed +2 broadsword named Stormbringer
	blessed +2 long sword named Demonbane
	wand of polymorph
	ring of teleport control
	ring of polymorph control
	2 blessed scrolls of enchant weapon

Use the scrolls of charging to recharge the wand of wishing and the
wand of polymorph at the first instant you get the "nothing happens"
message.  Use the enchant weapon scrolls to make your two swords +5.
It seems to me that you don't need any )'s other than these two.

I'd forget about the tinning kit.  It is easy to collect all the pick-axes
and extra tools you find (including chests and large boxes) and polymorph
them in a big pile to get a tinning kit or any other tool you need.
Having your kit blessed is nice, but not strictly necessary.  I'd
also forget about wishing for armor.  I prefer to collect all the worthless
armor I find and polymorph it until I get a polished silver shield, speed
boots (or jumping boots if I've already found or created a wand of speed
monster), guantlets of power, and a crystal plate mail.  If you have four
or so screenfuls of worthless armor you'll get these with little trouble.
Of course, by wishing for the armor you can get armor that already has lots
of enchantments, but I prefer to get the magical items listed above and
try to add the enchantments to the armor later when I can make use of
certain tools.  I find that with the two swords and +0 armor of the
types above I can withstand almost any attack, at least until I am in a
position to add the enchantments myself.


I have also found wands of wishing on the lower levels, but I didn't
yet know how to turn them into a win.  There are many things to learn
before one is ready for the lower levels.  I made the mistake of thinking
that because I had good weapons and good armor I could win the game easily.

good luck


